sentences.text:
The respondent police is directed to grant custody of the said vehicle viz., Mahindra & Mahindra Bolero B6 Motor Car bearing https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis registration No.KL-09-AV-4511 to the petitioner after causing necessary photographs and panchnama, within a period of 7 days from the date of compliance of the below mentioned condition Nos.(i) to (iii):
(i)The petitioner shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees ten thousand only) with two sureties each, for a like sum to the satisfaction of the learned Judicial Magistrate No.I, Pollachi.
The petitioner and the sureties shall affix their photographs and give the copies of their Aadhaar Card;

